From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:25:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix: whole ball on the launcher and a white bubble on blue

The source photo crops the ball at its bottom edge, which showed as a
flat cut inside the launcher mask. The circle is now reconstructed by
mirroring the gradient across the cut, so the whole ball fits the icon.
The settings bubble is recoloured white and sits on the blue background
instead of blue on grey.

Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
